@startuml
title UML State Transition Diagram - Farm Management System

[*] --> Idle : Start

state "Idle" as Idle
Idle: entry/Waiting for login
Idle: do/No action until login

state "LoggedIn" as LoggedIn
LoggedIn: entry/Main area displayed
LoggedIn: do/User can choose options

state "CheckMarket" as CheckMarket
CheckMarket: entry/Display market conditions
CheckMarket: exit/Back to main menu or Logout

state "PestControl" as PestControl
PestControl: entry/Display pest control help
PestControl: exit/Back to main menu or Logout

state "SoilSuggestions" as SoilSuggestions
SoilSuggestions: entry/Provide soil info and suggestions
SoilSuggestions: exit/Back to main menu or Logout

state "WeatherInsights" as WeatherInsights
WeatherInsights: entry/Display weather data based on location
WeatherInsights: exit/Back to main menu or Logout

state "LabourAvailability" as LabourAvailability
LabourAvailability: entry/Show labour details for location
LabourAvailability: exit/Back to main menu or Logout

state "LoggedOut" as LoggedOut
LoggedIn --> CheckMarket : Choose market conditions
LoggedIn --> PestControl : Choose pest control help
LoggedIn --> SoilSuggestions : Provide soil info
LoggedIn --> WeatherInsights : Request weather data
LoggedIn --> LabourAvailability : Request labour details

CheckMarket --> LoggedIn : Back to main menu
PestControl --> LoggedIn : Back to main menu
SoilSuggestions --> LoggedIn : Back to main menu
WeatherInsights --> LoggedIn : Back to main menu
LabourAvailability --> LoggedIn : Back to main menu

LoggedIn --> [*] : Logout

[*] --> Idle : Restart
@enduml
